WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.695 --> 00:00:02.242
KAMALA KHAN
How did she convince everyone

00:00:02.293 --> 00:00:03.632
that she's good?

00:00:04.781 --> 00:00:07.054
Good is not a thing you are, Kamala.

00:00:07.890 --> 00:00:09.460
It is a thing you do.

00:00:11.312 --> 00:00:12.312
KAMALA KHAN
I know dressing up

00:00:12.363 --> 00:00:13.687
 as Captain Marvel is weird.

00:00:13.913 --> 00:00:16.081
I spend too much time in fantasy land.

00:00:16.132 --> 00:00:17.405
Cool. Is this Nani's?

00:00:17.818 --> 00:00:19.455
MUNEEBA KHAN
That is just junk.

00:00:19.506 --> 00:00:21.506
♪♪

00:00:23.951 --> 00:00:24.818
KAMALA KHAN
Whoa.

00:00:26.652 --> 00:00:27.693
BRUNO CARRELLI
What does it feel like?

00:00:28.835 --> 00:00:30.148
KAMALA KHAN
Like an idea come to life.

00:00:35.185 --> 00:00:37.028
KAMALA KHAN
Everything's changing really fast.

00:00:39.175 --> 00:00:40.614
YUSUF KHAN
If you save one life...

00:00:42.662 --> 00:00:43.662
...you save the world.

00:00:45.921 --> 00:00:47.835
♪♪

00:00:49.016 --> 00:00:50.429
BRUNO CARRELLI
Are you sure that we can keep that on?

00:00:50.480 --> 00:00:51.687
- It's an homage.
- That's a lawsuit.

00:00:51.738 --> 00:00:53.124
KAMALA KHAN
Great. Then I'll meet Captain Marvel

00:00:53.175 --> 00:00:55.831
in court and we'll be the
first case in the American Judiciary

00:00:55.882 --> 00:00:56.757
to hug it out.

